# Assessment task: Stage 4 (Quadrant D) - Evaluate, redesign and price the architecture

The photo-sharing website currently runs on the Stage 3 architecture: an internet-facing Application Load Balancer in two public subnets; an EC2 Auto Scaling group of t3.micro instances (minimum 2, maximum 4) in two private subnets; one NAT gateway; Amazon RDS for MySQL db.t3.micro with Multi-AZ; an S3 bucket for photos; and a CloudFront distribution in front of the load balancer. Its bill of materials for a typical month is:

[
